## Next Steps for Production Use

To enable Web Analytics in production:

1. **Enable in Vercel Dashboard**:
   - Navigate to your project in the Vercel dashboard
   - Go to the Analytics section
   - Click the "Enable" button
   - This will add routes at `/_vercel/insights/*` after the next deployment

2. **Deploy to Vercel**:
   - Push your code to the connected repository
   - Vercel will automatically deploy
   - Analytics will start collecting data immediately

3. **Verify Analytics is Working**:
   - Visit your deployed site
   - Open browser DevTools → Network tab
   - Look for Fetch/XHR requests to `/<unique-path>/view`
   - This confirms analytics are being tracked

